OL,3,GNEWSAFan to see boxer whose videos
OL,4,Ahelped cancer fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lost her job after being
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with cancer has flown nearly
OL,8,F4,000 miles from the US to see the
OL,9,FBirmingham boxer who helped bring a
OL,10,Fsmile back to her face.
OL,12,FCassondra Gainey, of North Carolina,
OL,13,Fdiscovered Ben Whittaker, of
OL,14,FWolverhampton, through his social media
OL,15,Fvideos and said they made her laugh.
OL,17,F"I love his confidence and his fighting
OL,18,Fstyle, and I like that you're able to
OL,19,Fsee his personality through his
OL,20,Ffighting style," she told the BBC,
OL,21,Fafter her 3,899 mile (6274 km) journey.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
