OL,3,GNEWSAFan to see boxer whose videos
OL,4,Ahelped cancer fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Whittaker superfan's UK jaunt will
OL,7,Ftake her to Birmingham's Utilita Arena,
OL,8,Fwhere she will be sitting three rows
OL,9,Ffrom the front during his world title
OL,10,Feliminator bout against Conor Wallace
OL,11,Fon Saturday.
